# Ye: every record, credited

Every sample on Ye's released albums, with the record it comes from and the people who made it: the data under the page at https://claude.ai/artifact/ULBWH71L6XtWcZ6aiJEBLW. Drawn from the public record (Wikipedia, "List of Kanye West samples and sampling disputes", as of 2026-11-18) and from *Kanye Did Absolutely Nothing Wrong* (math repo, kanye-devotional/). The 2025 album *Cuck* and unreleased songs are left out of this set.


